  "details": "See the attached video. When looking directly forward, the chatbox input field gets cut off, but not when looking down or up. Resizing the window to full screen (16:9) and back to windowed (4:3) gives the expected result for 1024x768 resolution.\n\nExpected result: See the full chat input with the \"Chat\" title bar at all times, see the keyboard too.\n\nActual result: Looking forward cuts off parts of the top of the chatbox input.",
